# ClientFlow environment variables
#
# Everything here is OPTIONAL. The app runs fully without any of it:
# client workspaces are stored in your browser and PDFs are generated locally.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Sheets sync (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ClientFlow syncs to Google Sheets through an Apps Script Web App that you
# deploy from your own Google account, so there is no service-account key and
# no server to run. See "Google Sheets sync" in README.md for the 5-minute
# setup, then paste the resulting /exec URL here OR into Settings in the app.
#
# A value set in Settings always wins over this one, so this is just a default
# for a fresh browser.
VITE_SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=

# A shared secret you invent. Put the SAME string in the SYNC_TOKEN constant at
# the top of google-apps-script/Code.gs. It stops random traffic that finds your
# Web App URL from writing rows into your Sheet.
VITE_SHEETS_SYNC_TOKEN=
